@crew tomas
// Writer-commons, batch 1 (for the Voices sampler). Tomas's card is the head writer's. Nothing here goes past what
// STORY_ARCS.tomas has told (beats 1-4): no exam, no transfer list.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- {hi}. You're new too, aren't you? I'm Tomas. Watch. I'm sort of new as well.
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning! The washroom's free. Hot water till ten, then it's character-building.
? tier>=acquaintance time:night
- You're up too? I keep looking at the star map instead of sleeping.
? tier>=colleague
- {hi}. I took the long way round Deck 2 again. On purpose. Mostly on purpose.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- There you are! I saved you the window seat. Well, I sat in it. Same thing.   #warm

== feel
? mood:high
- Good day! Holt nodded at me. Just once. I think it was a nod.   #funny
? mood:low
- Bit quiet today. Sort of grey inside. It usually lifts by dinner.

== near
? act:gym
- Vance said "one more kilometre" and walked off. So I'm still going. I think he's gone.   #funny
? act:work
- On patrol. The Watch office has the best view of the lift. So, of everyone, really.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I write to my little brother every week. I make the job sound exciting. It is, mostly.
? tier>=colleague
- Where I grew up, the sky was the same grey every day. Out here it's never the same twice.

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance
- Observatory night! I've named three stars. Not officially. They don't know yet.   #funny

== week1
// The arrival evening, step A12 (plans/pillar4-plan.md Part 1): after dinner Tomas finds you in the junior common
// room or Bunk 1 and you have your first chat card. Day 0 only: Sunday, before the week1.d2 flag (Tuesday 06:00).
// The head writer and the onboarding engineer may want a sharper hook (an intro-step condition).
? week1:true weekday:sun time:evening !flag:week1.d2
- Oh good, you found the common room. It took me three days. I'm Tomas, from the bunk.
- How was dinner? Did Brennan call you "love"? She calls everyone that. You get used to it.
- That's how you chat, by the way. Tap someone and talk. I was terrible at it at first.
- Ask me anything. I know everything. Well. A week's worth of everything.   #funny
- Sleep whenever you like. Lights out is ten, Chloe says. Chloe means it.
- I'm really glad you're here. I was the newest for a whole week. It was a long week.   #warm
- Night, {me}. If you wake up and don't know where you are, that's normal. It's Deck 4.   #funny

// Writer-commons, batch 4: up to about 60. Exam lines only from beat:tomas.5; the transfer list from beat:tomas.6.

== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- {hi}! Did you see the stars on the way past? Proper ones tonight.
? tier>=acquaintance time:afternoon
- {hi}. I went the long way round Deck 2 again. I found a new long way.   #funny
? tier>=colleague warmth:cold
- There you are! I thought the lift had eaten you. It does that. I think.   #funny
? tier>=colleague deck:4
- {hi}, {me}. Bunk's tidy. Well, my half is. Yours is... characterful.   #funny
? tier>=close
- {hi}, {nick}. I saved you the last biscuit. You've no idea how hard that was.   #warm

== bye
? tier>=acquaintance
- See you back at the bunk. Don't get lost. Says me.
- Right. Patrol. Wish me luck. I mean, it's a corridor. Wish me luck anyway.   #funny
? tier>=colleague time:night
- Night, {me}. If you see a shooting star, it's mine. I asked first.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- Thanks for this. Really. You always make me feel less lost.   #warm

== feel
? mood:ok
- All right, I think. Sort of medium. Medium's fine, isn't it?
? mood:low tier>=friend
- Bit homesick. It comes and goes. It's going, now you're here.   #warm

== near
? act:leisure
- The window seat's free! Quick. Before someone else notices it.
? act:meal
- Is this the stew? I think it's the stew. It's probably the stew.   #funny
? deck:2
- Deck 2 always feels like a museum. A nice one. You whisper without meaning to.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- Vance talked me onto the treadmill. I don't know how. I was walking past.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- I'm not sure I've found my place yet. I'm looking. That counts, doesn't it?
? beat:tomas.5 tier>=friend
- Still haven't told Holt about the exam. Don't remind me. Do remind me. Soon.

== invite
? trad:observatory-night tier>=acquaintance
- Observatory night tonight! Come up? I'll show you the stars I've named.
? trad:film tier>=acquaintance
- Film night! I'll save you a seat. Not the one by the speaker. Trust me.
? trad:running tier>=colleague
- Running club? Vance will be there. Come and stand between us.   #funny

== accept
- {yes}! I'll be there. I'll probably be early. I'm always early. It's a nerves thing.
- Yes! Thanks for asking. Nobody asks me things. Well, you do.   #warm

== decline
- I can't, sorry. Patrol. But ask me again? I'd really like you to ask me again.
- Not tonight. I promised my brother a long letter. Another time?

== missed
- I waited for you. That's all right. Something came up, I expect. Next time?
- You didn't come. Did I get the time wrong? I usually get the time wrong.

== birthday
? birthday:me
- It's my birthday! I wasn't going to say. I've said. Is there cake? Is that rude?   #funny
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! I made you a card. It's got a star on it. Well, a dot. A star-ish dot.   #warm

== hint
- Got a minute? Not a big thing. A medium thing.

== week1
? week1:true weekday:mon time:morning
- Morning! Washroom, then breakfast. Breakfast's till eight. Left at the end. Probably.
? week1:true weekday:thu
- Inspection today. I've folded everything. I've folded my socks. Is that normal?   #funny
? week1:true weekday:fri tier>=acquaintance
- Sowing morning's tomorrow! You plant your own seedling. Come with me? Film night after.
? week1:true weekday:sat time:morning
- Ready? Garden. Seedling. Bring your hands. That's all you need. And maybe a towel.

== greet
? tier>=acquaintance act:work
- {hi}! I'm on patrol. Very official. Watch out. I'm watching. That's the job.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning weekday:mon
- Monday! Fresh start. I've got a list. I've lost the list. Fresh start.   #funny

== near
? deck:3
- The promenade at this hour! You can see half the ship from here. Well, a corridor.
? act:off
- Rest day. I'm going to write to my brother and then look at the stars. Big plans.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- Back home the sky was grey every day. Here I've got a whole star map. Under my bunk.
? tier>=colleague
- Holt terrifies me. In a good way. I think. Is there a good way? There must be.   #funny

== feel
? mood:high tier>=colleague
- Good day! I found the laundry on the first try. That's a first. I'm a new man.   #funny
